{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52251","headline":"诗（幷序） 十二 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平坐歌舞处，无由更习曲。\n琵琶绝巧（一作「咲」）声，琴弦断不续。\n花帐（一作「怅」）後人眠，前人自薄福。\n生坐七宝堂，死入土角触（郭校作「䚥」）。\n丧车相勾牵，鬼朴还相哭。\n日理（项、松尾校作「埋」）几千般，光影急迅速。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}